{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01TJKvDU5bjH5xDPADanFpzy","type":"tool_result","content":"82:// compiler lowers it to `cvttsd2si`, which yields the \"integer indefinite\"\n92://   (int)d            -> cvttsd2si 32-bit; out of range => INT_MIN\n93://   (long)d           -> cvttsd2si 64-bit; out of range => INT64_MIN\n101:pub fn d2i(d: f64) -> c_int {\n106:        c_int::MIN // cvttsd2si \"integer indefinite\" (covers NaN and +-inf)\n112:pub fn d2l(d: f64) -> i64 {\n123:pub fn d2u(d: f64) -> u32 {\n124:    d2l(d) as u32\n129:pub fn d2s(d: f64) -> i16 {\n130:    d2i(d) as i16\n135:pub fn d2us(d: f64) -> u16 {\n136:    d2i(d) as u16\n141:pub fn d2c(d: f64) -> c_char {\n142:    d2i(d) as c_char\n147:pub fn d2ul(d: f64) -> u64 {\n148:    // gcc lowers this as: if d < 2^63 use cvttsd2si, else cvttsd2si(d - 2^63)\n151:        d2l(d) as u64\n154:        (d2l(t) as u64) | 0x8000_0000_0000_0000","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01BBw2PtCUL3a3j3q9zozFnZ","session_id":"f3ff8386-8592-4dbd-8b83-c0778c2e2173","uuid":"eb02de70-9e33-4ed7-ad5e-b5130fc9c373","timestamp":"2026-08-14T20:03:32.593Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Fix float-to-int cast fidelity"}
