{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01KhusbQn9NaZEbevTgUHqvu","type":"tool_result","content":"11:492-/// The |e| >= 1e9 cases of C4 (including `i32::MIN`/`i32::MAX`).\n12:493-///\n13:494-/// `#[ignore]`d — run it with\n14:495-/// `cargo test --test numbers -- --ignored --exact c4b_fmtexp_out_of_range_exponent_subprocess`.\n15:496-/// This class of input is EXCLUDED from the automatic sweep because the C\n16:497-/// is undefined for it and its output is not even reproducible: with a\n17:498-/// 10-digit exponent `js_fmtexp` writes `se[9]`, one byte past its scratch\n18:499-/// array, which clobbers the adjacent loop counter `i`; the copy-out loop\n19:500-/// then emits ~50 bytes of raw stack (including ASLR'd pointers) into the\n20:501-/// caller's 32-byte buffer. The Rust translation panics instead\n21:502-/// (\"index out of bounds: the len is 9 but the index is 9\", and for\n22:503-/// `i32::MIN` \"attempt to negate with overflow\" at `-e`). The divergence is\n23:504-/// real but is a property of the C's UB, and asserting on it would be flaky,\n24:505-/// so it is documented here instead of failing the suite.\n25:506-///\n26:507-/// The probe runs in a re-exec'd copy of this test binary so that a crash or\n27:508-/// panic on either side cannot take the whole suite down; the parent\n28:509-/// compares (exit status, buffer contents).","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3ff8386-8592-4dbd-8b83-c0778c2e2173","uuid":"c7831e22-294c-4329-9ea2-805a84b74a57","timestamp":"2026-08-14T20:33:49.227Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"11:492-/// The |e| >= 1e9 cases of C4 (including `i32::MIN`/`i32::MAX`).\n12:493-///\n13:494-/// `#[ignore]`d — run it with\n14:495-/// `cargo test --test numbers -- --ignored --exact c4b_fmtexp_out_of_range_exponent_subprocess`.\n15:496-/// This class of input is EXCLUDED from the automatic sweep because the C\n16:497-/// is undefined for it and its output is not even reproducible: w